  "statements": [
    {
      "type": "Formula re: Contains",
      "notes": "Natrol Magnesium night is a powerful blend that helps you relax and sleep better so you wake up feeling rested and refreshed.\r\nMagnesium blend (includes Magnesium Glycinate): formulated with a high absorption blend that helps calm the mind and body\r\nSleep blend: formulated with Glycine and GABA to support a calm and relaxed state of mind, and melatonin to help you fall asleep fast."
    },
    {
      "type": "Formulation re: Other",
      "notes": "Magnesium can help in many other ways too:\r\nPromotes better mood and positive outlook\r\nSupports muscle relaxation\r\nSupports nerve and bone health\r\nA tasty and convenient way to replenish the body's magnesium levels\r\nThe is product is helpful for occasional sleeplessness."
    },
    {
      "type": "FDA Disclaimer Statement",
      "notes": "These statements have not been evaluated by the Food and Drug Administration. This product is not intended to diagnose, treat, cure or prevent any disease."
    },
    {
      "type": "Formulation re: Other",
      "notes": "Mood + stress\r\nA soothing sleep blend that calms the mind, relaxes the body, and promotes better sleep"
    },
    {
      "type": "Formula re: Contains",
      "notes": "Magnesium Night 325 mg per serving\r\nAs magnesium carbonate & glycinate + sleep blend"
    },
    {
      "type": "Formulation re: Does NOT Contain",
      "notes": "100% drug free"
    },
    {
      "type": "FDA Statement of Identity",
      "notes": "Dietary Supplement"
    },
    {
      "type": "Suggested/Recommended/Usage/Directions",
      "notes": "Suggested use: Easy to prepare. Adults, mix 1/2 tablespoon with 6 oz of water, let it fizz then stir thoroughly. Take 30-60 minutes before bedtime."
    },
    {
      "type": "Formulation re: Does NOT Contain",
      "notes": "No: Milk, egg, fish, crustacean shellfish, tree nuts, peanuts, wheat, soybeans, sesame."
    },
    {
      "type": "Precautions re: Children",
      "notes": "Warning: Not intended for individuals under the age of 12 years.\r\nConsult a physician before using this product if under the age of 18, taking medication, other products containing magnesium, have any medical condition, are pregnant or lactating, have an autoimmune condition or depressive disorder.\r\nKeep out of reach of children."
    },
    {
      "type": "Precautions re: Pregnant or Nursing or Prescription Medications",
      "notes": "Consult a physician before using this product if under the age of 18, taking medication, other products containing magnesium, have any medical condition, are pregnant or lactating, have an autoimmune condition or depressive disorder."
    },
    {
      "type": "Precautions re: All Other",
      "notes": "This product is not intended to treat insomnia or other sleep disorder.\r\nMelatonin may cause drowsiness or sleepiness, do not take when driving or operating heavy machinery, or consuming alcohol. If adverse reactions occur (Including gastrointestinal disturbance or diarrhea), discontinue use. For occasional short-term use only. Use only as directed and do not exceed suggested use. This product should never substitute healthy sleep practices.\r\nDo not use if safety seal is damaged or missing."
    },
    {
      "type": "Storage",
      "notes": "Store in a cool, dry place."
    }
  ],
